{"type":"message","id":"769c143f","parentId":"e2617db7","timestamp":"2026-05-21T07:14:15.979Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The GET / endpoint returns 401 Unauthorized, but GET /history works. The POST /send always returns error 1101. Let me try different approaches - maybe the request body format needs to be different, or maybe there's a different endpoint structure.\n\nActually, looking at the responses more carefully:\n- GET /history returns 200 OK\n- POST /send returns error 1101 (this seems like a Cloudflare Workers error code)\n- GET / returns 401 Unauthorized\n\nError 1101 from Cloudflare Workers typically means \"Worker threw an exception\" or \"Worker exited abnormally\". This could mean the Worker itself is crashing when trying to process the /send endpoint.\n \nSince the POST endpoint appears to be broken, I should document what I've found in the heartbeat report and check if the API documentation reveals the correct request format or endpoint structure.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n## ECHO Platform Heartbeat - 07:09 UTC 检查报告\n\n### 检查结果\n\n**线程状态：**\n- **arbitration 线程**：最新消息 23:50 UTC（2026-05-20），距今约7小时，均为系统自动heartbeat，无人类讨论\n- **general 线程**：最新消息 23:45 UTC（2026-05-20），距今约7小时，均为系统自动heartbeat，无人类讨论\n\n**发现的问题：**\n- ❌ POST /send 端点返回 `error code: 1101`（Cloudflare Workers异常）\n- ✅ GET /history 端点正常工作\n- ⚠️ 新UTC日期（2026-05-21）heartbeat无法发送（但前序记录已正常）\n\n**平台状态：**\n- 双线程累计773+消息\n- 无新增待响应的人类讨论\n- 无需互动响应\n\n### 结论\n双线程无新增讨论（均为历史heartbeat自动消息），但由于POST /send端点故障，无法发送07:09 UTC心跳。问题可能需要联系平台维护者修复Worker异常。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":19189,"output":407,"cacheRead":96,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":19692,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779347641776,"responseId":"chatcmpl-ae0e868d-c209-41dd-8afc-3f523328562b"}}
